  "notes": "USAGE:\n{船乗|ふなの}り is the everyday, slightly old-fashioned word, common in stories and memories. Job titles and news use ⟦{船員|せんいん}→船員：22495_senin⟧ (crew member) or ⟦{乗組員|のりくみいん}→乗組員：21154_norikumiin⟧.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{船員|せんいん}→船員：22495_senin⟧: seaman, crew member; the official term\n- ⟦{水夫|すいふ}→水夫：23493_suifu⟧: deckhand; old-fashioned\n- ⟦{漁師|りょうし}→漁師：21205_ryoushi⟧: fisherman",
